msgid "Maximum number of guests"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:294
msgid "For subscription products, the \"Maximum number of guests\" field (General tab, and on each variation of a variable subscription) sets how many people the buyer can invite to share the premium access, in addition to themselves. 0 or empty disables the feature; an empty variation field uses the product value."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:295
msgid "The value is recorded in each subscription at purchase: changing it does not affect existing subscriptions. The product must grant a WooCommerce Memberships plan."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:304
msgid "The \"Team access\" box shows the guest seats used by this subscription. Use \"Manage guests\" to see the guests, force the quota, revoke or resend invitations, or resynchronize."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Help.php:305
msgid "Changing the subscription status updates its guests' access: on hold suspends it, reactivation restores it, cancellation keeps it until the end of the paid period, expiration removes it."
msgstr ""

